<title>USA: Allegheny Teledyne to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Allegheny Teledyne to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allegheny Teledyne Inc said Thursday its board had authorized the repurchase of up to 12 million shares, from time to time in the open market.</p>
<p>As of December 31, 1996, the company had 174.4 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to fund the repurchase program from internally generated cash sources.</p>
<p>Goldman Sachs will be the exclusive agent for the repurchase program, Allegheny Teledyne said.</p>
</text>
